        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The Game\n- Products: Ali Bomaye, Jesus Piece, Grand Theft Auto V\n- Charts: Billboard Bubbling Under R&B/Hip-Hop Singles chart\n- Topics: video game soundtracks, radio stations\n\nFacts:\n- The Game is an American rapper.\n- \"Ali Bomaye\" is a song by The Game.\n- \"Ali Bomaye\" is the second track on The Game's fifth studio album \"Jesus Piece.\"\n- \"Ali Bomaye\" peaked at number one on the Billboard Bubbling Under R&B/Hip-Hop Singles chart.\n- \"Ali Bomaye\" appears in the soundtrack to \"Grand Theft Auto V.\"\n- The \"Grand Theft Auto V\" soundtrack's radio stations consist of licensed music, DJ chat, and spoof advertising.",
